{"id": "1545222697577873580", "channel_id": "1545222697577873580", "author_id": "1280181546527096993", "author_name": "fjantsa", "content": "> Caraboo's Exalt DMG hits count +2. The Max HP bonus from each stack of Satiety +50%. \n> Exalt Base DMG and Shield Generation +50%.\n\nSounds pretty neat right, +50% Base DMG/Shield on her exalt?\n\nNope!\n\nWhat you're actually getting\n> Each stack of Satiety increases Exalt Base DMG and Shield Generation by **__2→3__**%\n\nMaybe it's just a translation diff, but you can't really expect people to fact check everything against CN text when investing into characters.\n\n<:Aurita_dizzy:1529872679442845927>", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T00:03:19.952000+00:00", "thread_id": "1545222697577873580", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-04T00:04:40.327000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Winkle_omg", "emoji_id": "1468257899330539774", "count": 6}, {"emoji": "🐘", "emoji_id": null, "count": 9}, {"emoji": "💯", "emoji_id": null, "count": 2}], "attachments": [{"id": "1545222698672590920", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 107673, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1545222697577873580/1545222698672590920/image.png?ex=6a9b5c48&is=6a9a0ac8&hm=f90863e2c8e4e717b959c337089d9fa46884b1d6cc94640ed69ed1cda13ca290&"}, {"id": "1545222701885689907", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 56700, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1545222697577873580/1545222701885689907/image.png?ex=6a9b5c48&is=6a9a0ac8&hm=166dcad62cbf2e24c2a837da59e9465276c58d935fbe65e104c049bea6cc65ac&"}], "thread_title": "Caraboo E3 is kind of lying?", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"], "is_thread_starter": true}
