{"id": "1545223276324851712", "channel_id": "1544152565921611837", "author_id": "344158840448745472", "author_name": "bang8509", "content": "It’s already the fifth day since the D-Tide rework went live, and we still haven’t received a single official response.\n\nHonestly, I’m fucking tired of waiting.\n\nThis is not just about D-Tide being too difficult. The update has broken the difficulty curve, locked important progression behind unreasonable requirements, destroyed the value of many invested characters, and reduced team-building to a handful of specific mechanics and cheese strategies.\n\nNew players are struggling to progress. Mid-level players have nowhere to go. Even heavily invested players are asking themselves why they should keep spending when their investment can become irrelevant overnight.\n\nWe have given you days of detailed feedback, examples, numbers, clears, and solutions. At this point, the lack of communication is becoming an insult to the players who have supported this game.\n\nNobody is asking you to remove difficult endgame content. We are asking you to stop ruining the progression and balance that made Morimens worth playing.\n\nWe are still complaining because we still care about this game.\n\nBut our patience is running out.\n\nIt’s the fifth day. Enough is enough. Say something.", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T00:05:37.936000+00:00", "thread_id": "1544152565921611837", "reactions": [{"emoji": "🤣", "emoji_id": null, "count": 2}, {"emoji": "⬆️", "emoji_id": null, "count": 4}, {"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 2}], "thread_title": "D-tide Feedback (New)", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
{"id": "1545224560448897154", "channel_id": "1544152565921611837", "author_id": "231543819026300928", "author_name": "crowlov1", "content": "It's ridiculous especially for the whales. Wdym GLotan from one month ago S tier goes to Joke tier, simply cause she wasn't born with a silver spoon of %hp DMG.", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T00:10:44.095000+00:00", "thread_id": "1544152565921611837", "reactions": [{"emoji": "✅", "emoji_id": null, "count": 4}], "thread_title": "D-tide Feedback (New)", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
{"id": "1545225752902107206", "channel_id": "1544152565921611837", "author_id": "277927692735873035", "author_name": "sacred_promises", "content": "good news ! \n1) recent ratings have dropped below 70%! it was 74% last i checked \n2) numerous negative reviews with the help of the community ! \n\nbiav and the new management company has to understand that what their players feel <:Celeste_agree:1400771815076528258> \n\nwe do not accept poor balance management ! \n\nwe do not accept blatant senseless power creep! \n\nwe do not accept low effort predatory monetisation ! \n \nwe are not cash cows! \n\nlet our voices be known!", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T00:15:28.398000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1544152565921611837", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 10}, {"emoji": "⬆️", "emoji_id": null, "count": 9}], "attachments": [{"id": "1545225751320600639", "filename": "IMG_4463.png", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 172445, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1544152565921611837/1545225751320600639/IMG_4463.png?ex=6a9b5f20&is=6a9a0da0&hm=b276c0870fbea3a7ec758706624ce1ab161bb6454b8ebe2a951b5f8eb6933f2b&"}, {"id": "1545225751702413382", "filename": "IMG_4466.png", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 233549, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1544152565921611837/1545225751702413382/IMG_4466.png?ex=6a9b5f20&is=6a9a0da0&hm=bf69816736acbe23319be40472395e35fab15590e54e07d101c3e13a101ed1ba&"}, {"id": "1545225752172171324", "filename": "IMG_4467.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 36709, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1544152565921611837/1545225752172171324/IMG_4467.jpg?ex=6a9b5f20&is=6a9a0da0&hm=290370ab563d884adaa8cf5db217bd83cb25f3124f48bb267dbe090e94a8ef1b&"}], "reply_to": "1544879434912370750", "thread_title": "D-tide Feedback (New)", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
{"id": "1545236807501746296", "channel_id": "1544152565921611837", "author_id": "183632583215546378", "author_name": "vongrandea", "content": "Suggestion : \n\n1. At least... Please add **Refined Gnosis Fragment** reward on normal difficutly in current D-tide  ( 350 points ) ?\n\n2. and  **reduce Gnosis cost** from 3 to  2 \n\nReason : I understand the reason Dev want to cater to whales, and want to hold progression for new players, But i find my self starting to feel the wall on arc 2 , while im finding it hard with the current D-tide to get the materials <:Horla_cry:1357186646294138890> ( i'm mid player ). I'm one of the people who introduce this game to many friends because i thought it would be a fun adventure, playing cards with many different strategy , but the current feel full of... power hunger. \nso at the very least , **__please somehow put the rewards more reasonable to new-mid player.__**", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T00:59:24.020000+00:00", "thread_id": "1544152565921611837", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-04T02:06:43.304000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 4}], "thread_title": "D-tide Feedback (New)", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
{"id": "1545241671250477196", "channel_id": "1544152565921611837", "author_id": "614083839131648021", "author_name": "shostakovich524", "content": "我是你正在找的中文評論嗎？<:Ramona_tuff_:1441426630420467753> \n\n我會說我是新版融災唯一受益人，但其實也不能說我有受益。原本最多350的我打了新版後終於打到370了，終於是拿到靈核了<:Doll_sigh:1468259900655145213> \n\n1. 難度體感明顯提升了\n\n我是原版只能打最低難度那區的人，大概只能打40~60級的，偶爾第三波或者第五波會打70級的試試。新版的難度在我這裡明顯提升了，這次打的仍然是最低等級，但是我打得異常痛苦。如果最低等級也這麼難打，我不敢想像更高難度會出現什麼天文數字。最後一關是什麼東西，敵方血希太op了，建議我方血希也這樣加強，出張讓敵方的盾通通消失的卡好嗎？<:Brown_think:1459080117308620996> \n\n2. 材料獎勵太少且放在太高難度，有礙於玩家獲取\n\nBro我打了兩三天打得要死要活才到370，什麼叫我得提升隊伍才能拿到升級素材但是我需要拿到升級素材才能提升隊伍<:Aurita_please:1356053110375714817> 到底是為什麼要把升級材料放在接近中段的特訓值啦，明明萌新跟大佬都缺，我想吐槽很久了<:Horla_cry:1357186646294138890> 要不是為了再培養幾個角色，誰打融災啊<:Agrippa_stare:1468259401189294150> 是是是，我能力問題，我菜，我沒錢+12，所以我沒人權活該<:Tawil_loneliness:1460158738110349372> \n\n3. 噁心機制\n\n狂熱是誰想出來的？出一張牌加兩點就算了，你偶爾還會保底四點是什麼意思？寸止大挑戰？喜歡我滿手打不出去的卡嗎？那個會讓護盾通通消失(∠·ω )⌒★的技能就算了好嗎，算我倒楣。銀芯固化才是真屎，大大一坨狗屎👍🏻讓我不想評論這玩意到底有多狗屎👍🏻狂熱都沒這狗屎👍🏻👍🏻\n\n4. 逆天數值\n\n我都要懷疑你們是物價在漲工資不漲才來報復社會的，我們真的要用1600以上且最多大概4300(不確定)的血量打這玩意嗎？\n\n5. 想好該怎麼道歉了嗎？\n\n看在彌薩格全體師生的份上，我已經是最溫和的玩家了，甚至可以說我一看見校貓熬夜就心軟，也不是說很想一定要罵製作人或者策劃什麼的，更不想要把一個人徹底工具化，畢竟校貓還是一個人。但是你端這種東西出來給我們吃……大家都是來會員制餐廳當食雪漢的是不是<:Gross:1356053080906666126> 詩人嗎？我真的很想問，你們詩人嗎？別+12滿配了，+24吧，+12的角色也未必能打融災的話，+24吧，直接告訴我們說你們想賺錢並不可恥🛐", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T01:18:43.628000+00:00", "thread_id": "1544152565921611837", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 16}, {"emoji": "⬆️", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}, {"emoji": "🧡", "emoji_id": null, "count": 2}], "thread_title": "D-tide Feedback (New)", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
